        "content": "What function calculates the net lifetime savings from refinancing or exercising a mortgage rate float-down option by comparing fixed-rate loan payments at the original and reduced annual interest rates over the same term, then subtracting a one-time fee expressed as a percentage of the loan principal and rounding the result to the nearest dollar?",
